## Build artifacts
# Every npm project here lives in a subdirectory with its own rule; this
# catches a tool run from the repo root, which resolves its cache to a
# node_modules beside this file.
node_modules/
/.vercel/
/dist/
/apps/Donkey/ultralytics/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

## Bundled capability tools (large arm64 binaries; fetched by scripts/fetch-bundled-tools.sh)
/vendor/

## Local agent settings (per-machine permission mode; never shared)
/.claude/settings.local.json
/.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

## Project policy
# Keep Package.resolved tracked for reproducible dependency resolution.

# iOS app local build config (deployment OAuth ids)
apps/ios/Config/Donkey.local.xcconfig
